# The Gobbiebag Part X (jeuno 124): reqsMet's operands one at a time, in both checks. Parts I-IX completed (the chain's
# earlier parts, by a GM), Jeuno fame level 5. The inventory at 30 (a fresh char): no section (43 (81)); at 75 (storage,
# a GM's player:changeContainerSize): fame level 4 (649 / 2 = 324): no section; Part IX set accepted (a GM): no section;
# all met: 43 (76, 0, 1), begun. Accepted: fame level 4: no section; Part IX accepted: no section (Part IX itself: its
# size 70 unmet); all met: 43 (76, 1, 1). A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it
# completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 650
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartV completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx completed
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # the inventory 30, not 75: no section; 43 (81)
finish
storage inventory 75                    # a GM's player:changeContainerSize to the part's start size
fame Sandoria 649                       # a GM: fame level 4
trigger Bluffnix                        # below the fame level: no section; 43 (81)
finish
fame Sandoria 650                       # a GM
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx accepted # a GM: Part IX not completed
trigger Bluffnix                        # no section (Part IX: inventory 75 is not its 70); 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (76, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
fame Sandoria 649                       # a GM: fame level 4
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, below the fame level: no section; 43 (81)
finish
fame Sandoria 650                       # a GM
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx accepted # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the previous part not completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (76, 1, 1)
finish
